From 3c016aa9c103ca6d844f994e2f4f7c507954b8b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reuben olinsky <reubeno@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 03:54:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove five eMudhra emSign roots and their NSS trust records

Remove emSign Root CA - G1, emSign Root CA - G2, emSign Root CA - C2,
emSign ECC Root CA - C3 and emSign Root CS CA - G2 together with their
certificate and NSS trust records to enforce Azure Linux's eMudhra
certificate exclusion policy. Preserve all other certificate and trust
records.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 certdata.txt | 757 ---------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 757 deletions(-)

